# Public build-time values only: this file is bundled into the browser and the Worker.
# Public origin of the app. Web and API share it; the dev server proxies /api and /rpc.
VITE_SERVER_URL=http://localhost:3001
# Cloudflare Turnstile site key (optional; set it together with TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY on the server).
# VITE_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY=
# Passkey app association, served at /.well-known/assetlinks.json and apple-app-site-association
# (404 while unset). Public values, baked in at build time; keep them equal to the server's
# ANDROID_CERT_SHA256 (comma-separated SHA-256 fingerprints, keytool format).
# VITE_ANDROID_CERT_SHA256=
# Apple Developer team id (10 characters).
# VITE_APPLE_TEAM_ID=
# Dev only: extra hostnames Vite accepts in the Host header (a Cloudflare tunnel), comma-separated.
# Read by vite.config.ts, not bundled. See docs/guides/native-dev.md.
# DEV_PUBLIC_HOSTS=
